  data: {
    LLM: 'Lead with your strongest suit (the number you have the most of). This ensures you have more opportunities to play on the ends you create.\n\nSuit Control: Try to keep your strong suits at both ends of the line. This forces opponents to pass while you continue to shed tiles.\n\nBlocking: If you have a hand with low pip counts, you may deliberately block the game if you know opponents have high cards they cannot play. Tracking played tiles is essential to know which suits are exhausted.',
    Player: 'Lead with your strongest suit (the number you have the most of). This ensures you have more opportunities to play on the ends you create.\n\nSuit Control: Try to keep your strong suits at both ends of the line. This forces opponents to pass while you continue to shed tiles.\n\nBlocking: If you have a hand with low pip counts, you may deliberately block the game if you know opponents have high cards they cannot play. Tracking played tiles is essential to know which suits are exhausted.',
